^warning: ignoring
dropped the body
--
Clang's __is_trivially_equality_comparable: true for integral and pointer
types, false for floating-point, enumeration, array, reference, void and
std::nullptr_t.  A class with a defaulted operator== and no padding also
qualifies in clang; CBMC conservatively answers false for every class.
